{"cantica":"purgatorio","cantoNumber":29,"title":"Canto XXIX","totalDuration":380.96,"segments":[{"id":1,"speaker":"narrator","text":"She continued singing like a woman in love,\nand when her words ended, she sang:\n\"Blessed are those whose sins are covered.\"","startTime":0,"endTime":9.04,"words":[{"word":"She","start":0.24,"end":0.68},{"word":"continued","start":0.68,"end":1.04},{"word":"singing","start":1.04,"end":1.68},{"word":"like","start":1.68,"end":1.92},{"word":"a","start":1.92,"end":2.08},{"word":"woman","start":2.08,"end":2.4},{"word":"in","start":2.4,"end":2.56},{"word":"love,","start":2.56,"end":3.44},{"word":"and","start":3.44,"end":3.6},{"word":"when","start":3.6,"end":3.76},{"word":"her","start":3.76,"end":4.08},{"word":"words","start":4.08,"end":4.32},{"word":"ended,","start":4.32,"end":4.96},{"word":"she","start":4.96,"end":5.16},{"word":"sang:","start":5.16,"end":6.08},{"word":"\"Blessed","start":6.08,"end":6.8},{"word":"are","start":6.8,"end":7.16},{"word":"those","start":7.16,"end":7.44},{"word":"whose","start":7.44,"end":7.76},{"word":"sins","start":7.76,"end":8.24},{"word":"are","start":8.24,"end":8.6},{"word":"covered.\"","start":8.6,"end":9.04}]},{"id":2,"speaker":"narrator","text":"Like nymphs who once wandered alone through woodland shadows—\none seeking to avoid the sun, another yearning to see it—\nshe moved upstream along the bank,\nand I walked beside her, matching her small steps with mine.\nWe had not taken a hundred paces\nwhen both margins curved equally,\nturning me to face the east.\nWe had not traveled much farther\nwhen the lady turned completely toward me, saying:","startTime":9.04,"endTime":34.16,"words":[{"word":"Like","start":9.2,"end":9.52},{"word":"nymphs","start":9.52,"end":10.08},{"word":"who","start":10.08,"end":10.24},{"word":"once","start":10.24,"end":10.56},{"word":"wandered","start":10.56,"end":11.12},{"word":"alone","start":11.12,"end":11.48},{"word":"through","start":11.48,"end":11.68},{"word":"woodland","start"